Date: Sat, 6 Jun 2026 22:59:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: remove full-page watermark, show Ex Libris logo
 top-right

Remove the full-viewport background watermark (CSS opacity, filters,
and checkerboard-prone background-image). Show the original
ex-libris-watermark.png unchanged in the top-right: in TopHeader on
dashboard pages and fixed top-right on login/signup.
